      "bhavartha": "Twice in every line the singer bows to Śiva, eight bows in all, and each pair greets Him by a new name: the Lord who is everywhere, whose form is the whole universe; the One whose form is awareness and bliss; the One reached through austerity and meditation; and the One reached through the knowledge of the Vedas."
    },
